{"title":"AI重塑项目管理：淘汰低效管控重构组织核心竞争力","date":"2026-07-14","content":"<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px;\">AI重塑项目管理：淘汰低效管控重构组织核心竞争力</span></h1>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"70376\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:15px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:4.8em;margin:0 -30px -12px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:#8ed6fc;padding:7px 30px;margin:0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#fff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">前 言</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin:-4px 20px 0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:#fefefe;height:8px;width:8px;margin:0px;border-radius:50%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:#fefefe;height:8px;width:8px;margin-left:auto;border-radius:50%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin-top:14px;border:6px solid #EDF9FF;padding:20px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t过去的第一波AI浪潮，核心是提升单点生产力：自动化报表、生成会议纪要、简化基础行政工作。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t而当下的第二波AI浪潮，将彻底颠覆底层逻辑&mdash;&mdash;重塑组织的决策模式、资源配置方式和变革推进体系。这，才是企业管理者和项目经理必须紧盯的核心趋势。</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"70964\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section data-align=\"title\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2.5em;margin-left:auto;m;margin-right:-8px;margin-bottom:-25px;z-index:1;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(149, 202, 255) 0%, rgb(110, 182, 255) 100%);padding:5px 30px;margin:0px 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>传统项目管理的致命困境</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>只会记录，不会驾驭复杂</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(243, 243, 243);padding:4px;margin-top:-30px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:9px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qlogo.cn/mmbiz_png/oWag3KdTBd4zJ61tu93ggiapT5QLSQvXyLeiaZ44vUIXsWZ4KAhgPQ5q5gjrE7PNy1ZXSy0EWtRXgU3bILa8BgBemqia8zU6otT2zGT673814o/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;background-color:transparent !important;background-size:0px !important;border-radius:initial;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71048\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:-20px;margin-bottom:-11px;margin-right:33px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-right:5px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);padding:15px 14px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:2.53em;margin-top:0px;margin-left:27px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);padding:20px 15px;border-radius:14px;margin-top:-15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t数十年以来，我们的项目管理工具始终在做一件事：<strong>记录项目数据。</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t进度计划、预算、风险、里程碑、任务依赖&hellip;&hellip;所有信息都被完整留存，但<strong>记录复杂性，不等于驾驭复杂性。</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t这也是当下多数企业的深层痛点：即便持续投入数字化建设，项目超载、资源分散、优先级混乱、变革疲劳等问题依旧愈演愈烈。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t团队被海量并行项目拆分精力，高管深陷繁杂的状态汇报，传统管控模式，早已跟不上新时代变革的速度与复杂度。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\tAI的出现，绝非只是替代基础行政工作，而是从根源上解决这套传统体系的结构性短板。</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"70964\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section data-align=\"title\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2.5em;margin-left:auto;m;margin-right:-8px;margin-bottom:-25px;z-index:1;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(149, 202, 255) 0%, rgb(110, 182, 255) 100%);background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:5px 30px;margin:0px 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>核心变革：项目管理从</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>&lt;被动管控&gt;转向&lt;智能驱动&gt;</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(243, 243, 243);padding:4px;margin-top:-30px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:9px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qlogo.cn/mmbiz_png/oWag3KdTBd4zJ61tu93ggiapT5QLSQvXyLeiaZ44vUIXsWZ4KAhgPQ5q5gjrE7PNy1ZXSy0EWtRXgU3bILa8BgBemqia8zU6otT2zGT673814o/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"border-radius:initial;background-color:transparent !important;background-size:0px !important;vertical-align:bottom;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71048\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:-20px;margin-bottom:-11px;margin-right:33px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-right:5px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);padding:15px 14px 14px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:2.53em;margin-top:0px;margin-left:27px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);padding:20px 15px;border-radius:14px;margin-top:-15px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t传统项目管理诞生于稳定、可预测的商业环境，核心逻辑是：<strong>定范围、做计划、盯执行、控偏差。</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t但如今，市场、技术、供应链、客户需求瞬息万变，静态的规划、固化的流程，已经无法适配动态的市场竞争。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t真正的核心竞争力，不再是「计划做得够细致」，而是<strong>感知变化更快、调整优先级更灵活、落地变革更高效。</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\tAI的核心价值，就是让企业跳出单纯的「项目追踪」，实现「<strong>项目持续学习、智能预判优化</strong>」，完成从项目管控到项目智能的质变。</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"70964\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section data-align=\"title\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2.5em;margin-left:auto;m;margin-right:-8px;margin-bottom:-25px;z-index:1;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(149, 202, 255) 0%, rgb(110, 182, 255) 100%);background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:5px 30px;margin:0px 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>AI四大深层变革</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>重构项目管理体系</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(243, 243, 243);padding:4px;margin-top:-30px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:9px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qlogo.cn/mmbiz_png/oWag3KdTBd4zJ61tu93ggiapT5QLSQvXyLeiaZ44vUIXsWZ4KAhgPQ5q5gjrE7PNy1ZXSy0EWtRXgU3bILa8BgBemqia8zU6otT2zGT673814o/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"border-radius:initial;background-color:transparent !important;background-size:0px !important;vertical-align:bottom;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71048\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:-20px;margin-bottom:-11px;margin-right:33px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-right:5px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);padding:15px 14px 14px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:2.53em;margin-top:0px;margin-left:27px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);padding:20px 15px;border-radius:14px;margin-top:-15px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px 0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:100%;vertical-align:top;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;padding:21px;background-color:rgb(243, 249, 252);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.76923em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">市面上多数对AI项目管理的认知，还停留在自动化办公的浅层阶段。事实上，AI的变革是<strong>全方位、组织级的</strong>，核心集中在<span style=\"color:#0c74e7;\"><strong>四大维度</strong>：</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:13px 0px 0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;padding:0px 13px;border-top:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"color:rgb(102, 171, 204);margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>重构项目组合优先级决策</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;min-width:5%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:21px 0px 26px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:13px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t绝大多数企业不缺创新创意，缺的是资源聚焦。海量项目并行、优先级混乱、资源内耗，是企业普遍痛点。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAI可通过数据分析，精准识别高价值项目、模拟战略权衡、预判执行瓶颈、动态调配人力与财力资源，让年度静态的战略规划，变成实<strong>时适配、动态优化</strong>的智能决策，彻底解决项目超载问题。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;padding:0px 13px;border-top:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"color:rgb(102, 171, 204);margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>升级领导者的核心工作重心</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;min-width:5%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:21px 0px 26px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:13px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t勤于思，善于总结。分析之前的工作经历，使我们了解问题存在于什么地方，为以后的工作提供参考。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t高管最稀缺的资源是注意力。过去，领导者大量时间耗费在审报表、整信息、开治理会议等琐碎行政工作中。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAI全面承接重复性行政工作，解放管理者精力，让核心注意力回归<strong>战略判断、组织协同、 stakeholder管理、变革推进</strong>，完成从「事务执行者」到「战略架构师」的角色升级。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t提升效率，取精华去糟粕，方能提升自我。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;padding:0px 13px;border-top:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"color:rgb(102, 171, 204);margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>从被动风控到主动韧性管理</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;min-width:5%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:21px 0px 26px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:13px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t传统风险管理是滞后、被动的：定期梳理风险、登记造册、周期审查，无法应对快速迭代的业务环境。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAI可实时监控交付进度、资源负荷、财务数据、执行趋势，提前识别潜在风险，让企业从「事后补救的被动风控」，升级为<strong>事前预判、实时预警的组织韧性管理。</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:5%;height:auto;padding:0px 13px;border-top:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(102, 171, 204);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"color:rgb(102, 171, 204);margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>放大人类领导力的核心价值</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;min-width:5%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:9px 0px -9px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(255, 227, 167);border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:13px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tAI越普及，人的核心价值越珍贵。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t项目变革的成败，从来不只靠数据和流程，更依赖信任、文化、沟通、魄力、协同等人文能力，而这些是算法无法替代的。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t未来优秀的项目经理，必须兼具系统思维、情商、战略判断力、适配能力和AI应用能力，人文领导力将成为核心差异化竞争力。</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"70964\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section data-align=\"title\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:2.5em;margin-left:auto;m;margin-right:-8px;margin-bottom:-25px;z-index:1;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(149, 202, 255) 0%, rgb(110, 182, 255) 100%);background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:5px 30px;margin:0px 10px 0px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>落地价值：</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\"><strong>AI带给项目管理的直观收益</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(243, 243, 243);padding:4px;margin-top:-30px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:9px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qlogo.cn/mmbiz_png/oWag3KdTBd4zJ61tu93ggiapT5QLSQvXyLeiaZ44vUIXsWZ4KAhgPQ5q5gjrE7PNy1ZXSy0EWtRXgU3bILa8BgBemqia8zU6otT2zGT673814o/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"border-radius:initial;background-color:transparent !important;background-size:0px !important;vertical-align:bottom;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71048\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:-20px;margin-bottom:-11px;margin-right:33px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-right:5px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:20px;background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(237, 249, 255);padding:15px 14px 14px;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width:2.53em;margin-top:0px;margin-left:27px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"b